description: "Dependency pass 2026-11-28 under the seven-day cooldown (Dependabot default-days 7). Eligible: fast-json-patch 3.1.2 (runtime, published 2026-11-21T14:19Z), adopted with the runtime lock re-applied. Inside the window, so they stay: @types/node 26.6.11, vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 5.1.2, eslint-plugin-sonarjs 4.2.3, tar 7.5.24, fast-check 4.11.0, knip 6.48.0, marked 18.3.0 and typescript-eslint 8.74.0. Held by their owners: @codspeed/vitest-plugin 6.1.1 (the @codspeed/core 6.1.0 patch pin), the @sentry/node 11 major (the dependabot ignore rule), the TypeScript 7 major (pm-do5b) and npm-package-arg 14 (pm-ksr40d). pm-changelog moves from 2026.11.20 to the latest published 2026.11.27, reinstalled through pnpm changelog:pm:install so the managed source spec stays npm:pm-changelog. Duplicate check: the previous refresh is closed. There are no open Dependabot PRs or alerts."
